  "description": "A woman who dies after striking it rich with crypto wakes up inside a novel as a villainess. She’s told she can return to her world if she maintains a hated engagement for one year. While trying to endure by making deals and managing her hostile fiancé, she also faces interference from a dangerous male lead, making her mission far more complicated than expected.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69090672), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%ED%8F%AD%EA%B5%B0-%EC%98%A4%EB%B9%A0%EB%8A%94-%EB%8D%A4%EC%9E%85%EB%8B%88%EB%8B%A4/4825)",
